<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Reset your CoolBreeze Home Services password</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f4f6f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a2730;">
    <div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d5dce0;border-radius:8px;">
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;">Reset your CoolBreeze Home Services password</h1>
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Someone asked to reset the password for your CoolBreeze Home Services account. If that was you, choose a new password with the button below.</p>
      
      <p style="margin:8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://fixflow.example.com/reset-password?token=abc_DEF-123" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;background:#0f4c75;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Choose a new password</a></p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#4a5963;">If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><a href="https://fixflow.example.com/reset-password?token=abc_DEF-123" style="color:#0f4c75;word-break:break-all;">https://fixflow.example.com/reset-password?token=abc_DEF-123</a></p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The link works once and expires in 60 minutes.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
